{
  "schema":"SOMA-LLD-TYPES-V2",
  "lld_id":"LLD-05",
  "type_rules":["Every command request includes COMMAND_ENVELOPE_V1 and resolves its exact body contract from the named command leaf; path identities are immutable UUIDs unless explicitly WFM/provider identities.","All query cursors use CURSOR_V1 with deterministic owner-defined ordering; client-supplied aggregate/envelope/outcome values are never authoritative."],
